</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">CoordinateRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">19</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⁰</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FunctionField</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">19</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▶</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                  </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">7590601.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">❌️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">//</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsFractional</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">9</span><span class=\"bp\">⁰</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=?=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">//</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsFractional</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">CoordinateRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">19</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⁰</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▼</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                    </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">7590170.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">❌️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsFractional</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">9</span><span class=\"bp\">⁰</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=?=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsFractional</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">CoordinateRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">19</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⁰</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▼</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                      </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">7590114.000000</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">❌️</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Submodule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">9</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=?=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Submodule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">CoordinateRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">19</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FunctionField</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">19</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">▼</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Changing the statement of <code>mk_XYIdeal'_mul_mk_XYIdeal'</code> to</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">ClassGroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">XYIdeal'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ClassGroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">XYIdeal'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">ClassGroup</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">XYIdeal'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonsingular_add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hxy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>(i.e. inserting <code>W := W</code> three times) gives a 10x speedup in elaboration of this declaration, even though <code>W</code> can easily be inferred from the type of the <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>. For example the type of <code>h₁</code> is <code>W.Nonsingular x₁ y₁</code>. Am I right to be surprised by this? Why does the trace lose track of this? Is there something wrong with the definition of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=WeierstrassCurve.Affine.CoordinateRing.XYIdeal%27#doc\">docs#WeierstrassCurve.Affine.CoordinateRing.XYIdeal'</a> somehow?</p>",
