    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/39124\">#39124</a> FWIW (a 15% speed-up of the file).</p>\n<p>Full disclosure: this was actually discovered when an experimental branch showed me that <code>fast_instance%</code> can actually make mathlib slower! The branch <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/39119\">#39119</a> made the declarations I'm talking about above much worse, simply because on that branch typeclass inference took even longer to fail.</p>",
